    - Never truncate critical information unnecessarily

2.  Keyboard handling:
    - Login screen
    - Registration forms
    - Search fields
    - Fee entry forms
    - Profile editing
    - Ensure: resizeToAvoidBottomInset, scrollable forms, MediaQuery.viewInsets

3.  SafeArea:
    - Apply at correct screen boundaries (top-level Scaffolds)
    - Protect against: status bar, notch, Dynamic Island, bottom gesture bar
    - Do NOT blindly wrap every nested widget in SafeArea

